00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:54.666
-No.
-And guess what?

00:03:54.666 --> 00:03:56.269
No one batted an eye.

00:03:56.269 --> 00:03:58.070
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.440
New York City, baby.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.974
